[
  {"comment": "Bounding solids (mitcad#460). A 60 x 40 x 20 block (d1, d2, d3; Body1) with a vertical edge rounded (Fillet1 F3, d4 = 2) and a cylinder of 20 x 30 at (100, 20) (Cylinder1 F4, d5, d6; Body2): the box bounds the exact geometry, the cylinder's round side too."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 60, "height": 40},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 20}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "fillet", "body": "F2.b0",
    "edges": ["E{F2:side(c1[c4,c2])|F2:side(c2[c1,c3])}"], "radius": 2}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "cylinder", "plane": {"type": "origin", "plane": "xy"},
    "center": [100, 20], "diameter": 20, "height": 30, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 2, "body": "Body2", "volume": 9424.77796076938,
    "bbox": {"min": [90, 10, 0], "max": [110, 30, 30]}, "tolerance": 1e-4}},

  {"comment": "Around every body, 5 mm off on every side (BoundingSolid1 F5, d7; Body3): (0, 0, 0)..(110, 40, 30) grown to 120 x 50 x 40, a new body with a box's faces; the bodies stay as they were."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "bounding_solid", "margin": 5}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "BoundingSolid1", "status": "ok", "bodies": 3, "body": "Body3", "volume": 240000,
    "faces": 6, "bbox": {"min": [-5, -5, -5], "max": [115, 45, 35]}, "tolerance": 1e-4,
    "has_face": "F5:side1", "has_edge": "E{F5:side0|F5:top}"}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body1", "volume": 47982.831853072}},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body2", "volume": 9424.77796076938}},

  {"comment": "The box follows its bodies: the cylinder 50 high, then the block 130 wide."},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d6", "value": 50},
  {"expect": {"feature": "BoundingSolid1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body3", "volume": 360000,
    "bbox": {"min": [-5, -5, -5], "max": [115, 45, 55]}, "tolerance": 1e-4}},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d1", "value": 130},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body3", "volume": 420000,
    "bbox": {"min": [-5, -5, -5], "max": [135, 45, 55]}, "tolerance": 1e-4}},

  {"comment": "And its margin: none, then one that leaves no box, which fails the feature; undone."},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d7", "value": 0},
  {"expect": {"body": "Body3", "volume": 260000,
    "bbox": {"min": [0, 0, 0], "max": [130, 40, 50]}, "tolerance": 1e-4}},
  {"cmd": "set_parameter", "name": "d7", "value": -30},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 2, "feature": "BoundingSolid1", "status": "error", "error_contains": "leaves no box"}},
  {"cmd": "undo"},
  {"expect": {"bodies": 3, "feature": "BoundingSolid1", "status": "ok", "body": "Body3", "volume": 260000,
    "tolerance": 1e-4}},

  {"comment": "Around the cylinder alone, 1 mm off (BoundingSolid2 F6, d8; Body4): 22 x 22 x 52."},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "bounding_solid", "bodies": ["F4.b0"], "margin": 1}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "BoundingSolid2", "status": "ok", "bodies": 4, "body": "Body4", "volume": 25168,
    "bbox": {"min": [89, 9, -1], "max": [111, 31, 51]}, "tolerance": 1e-4, "has_face": "F6:bottom"}}
]
